# Content that Amalith embeds with `include_str!` and writes back out for
# another tool to read has to keep LF on every platform. A Windows checkout
# with `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise give `SKILL.md` CRLF endings,
# breaking its YAML frontmatter, and would install a CRLF zsh function.
crates/amalith-shell/assets/agent/SKILL.md text eol=lf
*.zsh text eol=lf

# Shell scripts are run on Unix; CRLF makes the shebang line unusable.
*.sh text eol=lf
